Independent ResearcherReleased September 2025

# SOLD

De novo drug design model generating target-conditioned ligands by latent diffusion over 1D SELFIES strings, conditioned on protein sequence alone.

## The short version

  * —ESM-2 embeddings are fine-tuned during diffusion training rather than held fixed
  * —Runs diffusion over 128-position latents with 256 channels, avoiding equivariant architectures
  * —Joint reconstruction and RDKit descriptor regression organizes the latent by chemical properties
  * —Generates hits against targets that have no reliable pocket structure


